    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7c672b59bb2a47288af68701ae219c8a",
      "statement": "The example verification request sends an Idempotency-Key header and refers to the identity document through an opaque documentToken rather than raw document data; the example response returns id, status, riskRating and the list of checks (id, sanctions, pep).",
